{"schema": 2, "id": "ruler-TNG", "title": "Dynastie Tang", "label": "dynastie Tang", "description": "dynastie chinoise", "extract": "La dynastie Tang est une dynastie chinoise précédée par la dynastie Sui (581-618) et suivie par la période des Cinq Dynasties et des Dix Royaumes. Elle a été fondée par la famille Li, qui prit le pouvoir durant le déclin et la chute de l'empire Sui.", "type": "ruler", "typeLabel": "Souveraineté", "continents": ["Asie"], "epochs": ["moyen-age"], "from": 618, "to": 906, "itemCount": 120, "items": ["Andong", "Anqing", "Beijing", "Bozhou", "Cao Bang", "Changsha", "Changzhi", "Chaozhou", "Chengde", "Chenzhou", "Dalian", "Daming", "Datong", "Fengyang", "Fengyuan", "Fuyang", "Fuzhou", "Gaizhou", "Gansu", "Ganzhou", "Guangnan", "Guangxi", "Guangzhou", "Guilin", "Guiyang", "Guyuan", "Ha Tinh", "Hainan", "Hami", "Handan", "Hangzhou", "Hanyang", "Hefei", "Hejian", "Hengyang", "Hetu Ala", "Hohhot", "Hongkong", "Hotan", "Huai'an"], "source": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dynastie_Tang", "articleLicense": "CC BY-SA 4.0", "image": "", "imageCredit": {"filename": "唐疆变迁.gif", "artist": "玖巧仔", "license": "CC BY 3.0", "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0", "credit": "Own work", "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%94%90%E7%96%86%E5%8F%98%E8%BF%81.gif"}, "revision": "", "sha256": "9b14967b52de58fcb37137cfac01895bb8227714cfba4709afd9a0e1012ce8d0"}